{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_ray_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_ray_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"夜晚荒漠上的鱗群","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_ray_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"e50e64ff33a4a655eb2093e29b5adf41b4ec5e7443a4591002591f1c3f5e5ebe","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"54_g2_cavekitchen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬧哄哄的人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快！已經一點了，吃完午餐我們就要開始準備食材了！第一道菜必須是黃金蘿蔔，你聽我的，沒有黃金蘿蔔，聚餐就不是聚餐了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬧哄哄的人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"盤子在哪裡？盤子不夠了！還有碗，還有桌椅……都分別再來二十個！我十三舅他二姨的大妹妹都來了，還帶著她的五個小孩，真熱鬧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬧哄哄的人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉呀！我來這裡就是想煮一頓大餐給你們吃，是客人又怎麼樣，你們還能不讓我煮飯嗎？快點把鍋鏟還給我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙地獸，過來一點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼吵鬧，你不害怕嗎？你很喜歡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷！嗷！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"杰里，在那裡，我看到萊伊了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，萊伊！這裡，在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……有人叫我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰里，我看到你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真不好意思……人實在太多了，剛剛應該是我這輩子吼最大聲的一次！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和吉拉度完蜜月回來後，想要請客感謝你們，然後不知道怎麼回事，邀請名單上的人越變越多……不過我很開心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為這裡所有人都沒想到，我和吉拉在逃婚之後，反而會在一起……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……杰里，這裡實在是太吵了，我聽不到你在說什麼……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，不然你再大聲一點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深吸一口氣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你今天來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟吉拉，都——很——開——心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我聽到了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還想說！我跟吉拉都覺得！如果當時沒有你，後面的很多事情都不會發生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會有我和吉拉四處躲藏然後相遇！不會有我們兩個一下子熟悉了彼此！還有後面的事！我們真的很——感——謝——你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我也聽到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒想到我竟然這麼關鍵？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當——然！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒有你劫車！或許我和吉拉這輩子都不會再遇到！我說不定什麼時候又會被一個不是由我做出的決定牽著走……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以！萊伊，我們真——的很感謝你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很感謝你當時劫——車！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬧哄哄的人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九姑","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劫車？你聽到了嗎？不是我聽錯了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九姑","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得杰里說過他被劫車了，後來他們還硬闖出入境檢查，甚至還跟檢驗官起了衝突——是她做的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"六叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？我聽不到……！你說，是她劫走了杰里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"十七姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？太吵了！——你說她為了杰里劫車？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"十四哥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！她硬闖出入境檢查還襲擊了檢驗官，就為了劫車帶走杰里？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬧哄哄的人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——什麼？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，萊伊，我們還有太多事情要忙……你還記得你坐在哪裡吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記得，在間歇泉三號棚子第十二桌六號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左邊是溫米，右邊是阿蘭娜，還有一個木箱給你的沙地獸用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊伊，晚上一定要好好嚐嚐我們家的飯！我們到時候再見！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（愉快地舒展背扇）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（開心地刨動沙土）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙地獸，這裡不是我幫你搭的房間，你不可以這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷！嗷——嗷嗷！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自從你回到雷姆必拓，就一直很興奮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g5_rmbtwild_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沙地獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我存了一點錢，明天我們可以不用工作，我現在就帶你去荒野上玩一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你想去荒野上跑，去鑽洞，挖沙子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，就在那邊。你先去，我在這裡搭個棚屋，我看著你玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——嗷！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙地獸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗷，嗷——嗷！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"54_g2_cavekitchen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沙地獸，我們趁這次機會，出去玩吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很久以前帶著沙地獸……我的第一隻沙地獸去荒野上玩過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠那時看起來也很高興，和你現在一樣高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（指著窗外的荒野）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也出去玩吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（興奮地蹭蹭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們先去找一份地圖，然後去幫你找一些零食，最後跟蘭娜借一下她的車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，沙地獸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再鬧哄哄的人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九姑","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個女孩是不是在杰里和吉拉走之後就一直在跟那隻沙地獸說話？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"十七姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她之前還為了帶走杰里劫車……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"六叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她現在的狀態看起來不是很好啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"十七姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？你們看……她怎麼這樣就走了？她不想聚餐了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"十七姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不太對吧，你們要不跟著她看看，不要讓她一個人獨處……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g3_rmbttown"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九姑","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在遠處跟著她，放心，她出門後就直接去了小鎮外面的小店，可能是想去買點什麼東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九姑","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我看著她走進去了。別擔心，我順便再買一點食材回來，你們說還缺什麼東西？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九姑","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瘤奶、洋蔥、起司……嗯嗯，好……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g3_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得蘭娜跟我說是這裡……屍體標本、骨骼、照片……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，很好辨認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人在嗎？我想要一份附近大型沙地獸洞穴的分布圖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蛤？你又是誰？地圖……你也是為了“夜晚荒漠上的鱗群”過來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說過這個傳說，但我不是為了這個來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是為了什麼？都把我這裡當成什麼地方了？許願屋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是探井人，這是我之前的工作證、體檢報告、出勤記錄……作為你幫助我的回報，我可以帶你去你想去的廢棄礦井，或是地下洞穴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一次遇到像你這樣的人，感覺就像在投履歷一樣。好吧，我先看看……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？這個小東西，你竟然可以馴服牠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是牠自己主動跟著我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主動……？哼，有點東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……這是羅德島的飯卡？你是羅德島的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，當過探井人，馴服了沙地獸，還是羅德島幹員……能被博士看上的都還是有點本事的。給你，這是分布圖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留一個聯絡方式給我，下次要探地穴，我會提前通知你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g3_rmbttown"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九姑","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，東西買完了，讓我看看她在哪……嗯？等等……她、她去的這家店是幹什麼的？這是什麼動物的屍體吧？這是人的骨頭吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九姑","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太可怕了，太可怕了——不行，我不能讓她一個人待在這種地方……我、我要進去看看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九姑","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——快、快點放開我的客人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石棉","speakerId":"avg_378_asbest_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……啊？今天有完沒完啊？你又是從哪裡冒出來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九姑","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……咦？怎麼只有你一個人？她、她呢……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九姑","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，我好像跟丟了……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g4_rmbtwild_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"十四哥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係啦，放心，我剛好要從礦區這邊洗幾個烤肉桶回來，接到你的訊息之後沒多久我就看到她從那邊過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"十四哥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，她跟那隻沙地獸都在，我猜應該十幾分鐘之後你們就能看到她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"十四哥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們還差四個烤肉桶嗎？好，我馬上拿過去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g4_rmbtwild_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙地獸，你看，我們要找的在那邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些長在礦洞裡的蘑菇和苔蘚很好吃，還能幫助沙地獸排毒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然是出去玩，今天可以少吃點飼料，多吃點蘑菇和苔蘚，就當作是“野餐”吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走，我帶你去找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙地獸，抓緊我，我們要降下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——嗷！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"十四哥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——喂——你要幹什麼？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"十四哥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，有個不好的消息——我剛剛把一個烤肉桶刷乾淨之後，一抬頭就看到她下去礦井了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"十四哥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是一個廢棄的礦井，我一個人也不敢就這樣下去，我……我會在礦井口看著，直到她再上來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g6_rmbtmine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……頭上好像有什麼聲音，沙地獸，你聽到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（咀嚼聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……可能是風聲吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙地獸，少吃一點。我們還要帶一點蘑菇和苔蘚出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你如果吃到電梯超重，我們就上不去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"二十分鐘後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g6_rmbtmine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗝——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，你再打一個嗝，說不定電梯就不會超重了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷！嗷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——嗝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，還真的好了。抓緊我吧，沙地獸，我們要升上去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在只剩下最後一件事。我們跟蘭娜借一下她的車。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"54_g2_cavekitchen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間還來得及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘭娜，我想借一下你的車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？幹嘛，要出遠門？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？萊伊姐，你不參加聚餐了嗎？我還做了甜肉湯耶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，我只是突然想帶沙地獸出去玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上聚餐前我會回來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會回來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我之前離艦去看馱獸在月亮下跳舞，結果挨罵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人事幹員說我下次要先報告，不然會給大家的工作帶來麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你跟我說，每次做決定之前，我可以先想一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萊伊停頓了一下，她再次思考了一陣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想了一下，杰里和吉拉一直跟我說他們很感謝我。如果我不回來聚餐，他們應該會傷心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我會回來的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萊伊說完，像是終於想通了一個大問題，並對答案感到滿意一樣，輕輕地點了一下頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我會回來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，沒想到你還真的記住我說的這句話了！那好，這是鑰匙，你注意安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊伊姐，那你聚餐時一定要吃我做的甜肉湯哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我會記得的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……終於和每一位客人都打了招呼，也安排好座位了……累死了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在休息一下吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真好，事情都忙完了的感覺……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不好了，不好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉拉&杰里","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九姑","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好了，我們把她跟丟了！誰還見過那個安靜的卡特斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九姑","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看著她進去一間很不對勁的小屋，裡面放滿了骨頭屍體，小屋裡的那個人看起來也很嚇人，不知道她在裡面發生了什麼事情！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"十四哥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"九姑跟丟後馬上就傳了訊息給我們，我剛好看到她在附近，結果晚了一步，她一下子就降到一個廢棄礦井裡了，我怎麼叫都沒有人回應！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"六叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？不對啊，我剛剛在這裡看到她了，她開車往那邊去了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉拉&杰里","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰？往哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"六叔朝著窗外指了指。\n人們齊齊看向那邊——一道煙塵逐漸消失在天際線。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"六叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"往南。那裡因為有太多沙地獸的洞穴，所以沒有礦洞，也沒有小鎮……是個無人區……她是不是狀態不好，要去……要去自殺……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉拉&杰里","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"六叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰里，她之前甚至為了你劫車，你們不能就這樣讓她一個人亂跑啊……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉拉&杰里","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g5_rmbtwild_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"沙地獸群悠閒地翻著沙土，在無垠的荒漠中慢慢地散著步，享受著戈壁夜晚的溫度。\n運載車遠遠地停下，從上面跳下來一人一獸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙地獸，你看，我們到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，我再幫你整理一下這些蘑菇和苔蘚……嗯，現在剛剛好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去玩吧，你肯定會喜歡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小沙地獸歡呼一聲，衝進了眼前的沙地獸群中。牠在裡面開心地翻來滾去，蹭著每一隻沙地獸的身體。\n獸群並不排斥這隻突然出現的小獸，牠們溫柔地接納了牠，親暱地嗅聞著牠身上的氣息。\n只因為牠們都身披同一種蘑菇和苔蘚，並時不時因為碰撞而發出微小的螢光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙地獸群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗷——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙地獸群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗷——嗷——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷！嗷！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萊伊同樣身披著那些柔軟的、時不時因為觸碰而發出螢光的蘑菇與苔蘚。她輕嗅著植物淡淡的清香，慢慢地跟在獸群的後面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g5_rmbtwild_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙地獸，給你，快吃吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些是我自己翻書找來的蘑菇和苔蘚，吃了之後你背上的血管顏色就會變正常，你就不會不舒服了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙地獸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……吭……吭……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙地獸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……吭……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"舒服一點了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起……我下次會再早一點發現的。我會全程緊緊跟著你的，沙地獸，就算是在清理感染生物的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會讓你離開我超過五步了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙地獸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗷……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷，嗷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你站起來了，你恢復了嗎？你沒事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷，嗷……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，沙地獸，太好了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萊伊伸出手，慢慢地撫摸著沙地獸的背扇，檢查著裡面血管的顏色，確認牠真的已經恢復。\n沙地獸用自己的頭親暱地蹭了蹭萊伊的手，在她的懷中換了一個舒服的姿勢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沙地獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我存了一點錢，明天我們可以不用工作，我現在就帶你去荒野上玩一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你想去荒野上跑，去鑽洞，挖沙子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，就在那邊。你先去，我在這裡搭個棚屋，我看著你玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——嗷！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙地獸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗷，嗷——嗷！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沙地獸就這樣興奮地跑向荒野，但沒跑幾步，牠又折返了回來，用自己的頭輕輕地撞著萊伊的腳踝。\n像是在邀請她一起在荒野上奔跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想叫我跟你一起去玩嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，唉呀，沙地獸，你太興奮了，你撞到我站不穩了，這些蘑菇和苔蘚都撒出來了……撒到我們全身都是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，你看，好像它們被你撞了一下之後，會發光？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還蠻好看的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們就一直披著它們吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走，我先不搭棚屋了，我們一起去玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙地獸，跟上我哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g5_rmbtwild_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這群沙地獸，是那個時候學會的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在地下鑽洞的時候有時會鑽進礦洞裡，所以也學會了用這些東西來解毒？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"獸群不會回答這個和牠們一樣身披著蘑菇與苔蘚的卡特斯。\n獸群只是開心地擠來擠去，讓身上這些東西一次次發出螢光，然後再把它們吞進嘴哩，津津有味地咀嚼。\n夜色中，沙地獸群如同在沙漠上憑空遨遊，就像毫無所依的龐大鱗群，緩慢地游向粼粼的月光。\n萊伊站在原地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我第一次見到這樣的景色……原來“夜晚荒漠上的鱗群”，是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是……是和沙地獸有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和我的“沙地獸”有關。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萊伊奔跑起來，她的四周再次發出微小的螢光。\n她追上了沙地獸群，像是一條離群的鱗回到了牠的族群身旁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（悠揚的哨聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……呼……沙地獸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙地獸！我是不是應該幫你取一個名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幫我的第一隻沙地獸也取一個名字！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫你什麼比較好呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫……“亮亮”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像不太喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那“閃閃”呢？或者是，“光光”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小沙地獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗷……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，你都不太喜歡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可能確實不太擅長取名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我再想想……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……嗯……你一直嗷嗷地叫，要不然就暫時叫“嗷嗷”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暫時叫“嗷嗷”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"54_g2_cavekitchen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別緊張，別緊張！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉呀！杰里和吉拉剛才都跟你們講清楚了，都是誤會！萊伊她根本不是為了帶走杰里才去劫車，也不是想一個人去無人區自殺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她只是想帶著沙地獸出去玩一下，沒事啦，你們不要緊張！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不信的話，你們問小鍋蓋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，蘭娜姐說的是真的，萊伊姐說過了，晚上聚餐之前她一定會回來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1184_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聚餐定在了九點半，還有兩分鐘……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"半信半疑的眾人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的會回來嗎？真的不會出事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"半信半疑的眾人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們真的不用出去找找嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，萊伊答應過，她會回來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馬上就到九點半了，聽我說……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聚餐——開始！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，我回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愣住的眾人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想想……我的座位是間歇泉三號棚子第十二桌六號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愣住的眾人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左邊是小鍋蓋，右邊是蘭娜，還有一個木箱給嗷嗷用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，是這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暫時叫“嗷嗷”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愣住的眾人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"………………"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，烤肉很香，燉菜看起來也不錯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事？大家都不吃飯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"六叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個……我們想請問一下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"六叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一個人開車衝去無人區，真的不是一下子想不開，要去做傻事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九姑","speakerId":"avg_npc_1186_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你去那間很恐怖的小屋，真的不是去買什麼毒藥，或者是別的可怕的東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"十四哥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1185_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你下去廢棄礦井，也不是什麼崩潰到走錯路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你們在說什麼？都不是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是帶牠去野餐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊伊","speakerId":"avg_4117_ray_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萊伊抱起腳邊吃得肚子滾圓的小沙地獸。\n小沙地獸稍微扭捏了一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暫時叫“嗷嗷”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1188_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——嗝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們看，我就說吧！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1183_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家開動！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
